our les humains","tr":"Wa Ma Ja`alna 'Ashaba An-Nari 'Illa Mala'ikatan Wa Ma Ja`alna `Iddatahum 'Illa Fitnatan Lilladhina Kafaru Liyastayqina Al-Ladhina 'Utu Al-Kitaba Wa Yazdada Al-Ladhina 'Amanu 'Imanaan Wa La Yartaba Al-Ladhina 'Utu Al-Kitaba Wa Al-Mu'uminuna Wa Liyaqula Al-Ladhina Fi Qulubihim Marađun Wa Al-Kafiruna Madha 'Arada Allahu Bihadha Mathalaan Kadhalika Yuđillu Allahu Man Yasha'u Wa Yahdi Man Yasha'u Wa Ma Ya`lamu Junuda Rabbika 'Illa Huwa Wa Ma Hiya 'Illa Dhikra Lilbashari","w":[["وَ|P|REM|PREF|LEM:و","مَا|P|NEG|LEM:ما"],["جَعَلْ|V|PERF|VF:1|ROOT:جعل|LEM:جَعَلَ|1P","نَآ|N|PRON|SUFF|1P"],["أَصْحَٰبَ|N|ROOT:صحب|LEM:أَصْحاب|MP|ACC"],["ٱل|P|DET|PREF|LEM:ال","نَّارِ|N|ROOT:نور|LEM:نار|F|GEN"],["إِلَّا|P|RES|LEM:إِلّا"],["مَلَٰٓئِكَةً|N|ROOT:ملك|LEM:مَلَك|MP|INDEF|ACC"],["وَ|P|CONJ|PREF|LEM:و","مَا|P|NEG|LEM:ما"],["جَعَلْ|V|PERF|VF:1|ROOT:جعل|LEM:جَعَلَ|1P","نَا|N|PRON|SUFF|1P"],["عِدَّتَ|N|ROOT:عدد|LEM:عِدَّة|F|ACC","هُمْ|N|PRON|SUFF|3MP"],["إِلَّا|P|RES|LEM:إِلّا"],["فِتْنَةً|N|ROOT:فتن|LEM:فِتْنَة|F|INDEF|ACC"],["لِّ|P|P|PREF|LEM:ل","لَّذِينَ|N|REL|LEM:الَّذِي|MP"],["كَفَرُ|V|PERF|VF:1|ROOT:كفر|LEM:كَفَرَ|3MP","وا۟|N|PRON|SUFF|3MP"],["لِ|P|PRP|PREF|LEM:ل","يَسْتَيْقِنَ|V|IMPF|VF:10|ROOT:يقن|LEM:اسْتَيْقَنَتْ|3MS|MOOD:SUBJ"],["ٱلَّذِينَ|N|REL|LEM:الَّذِي|MP"],["أُوتُ|V|PERF|VF:4|PASS|ROOT:أتي|LEM:آتَى|3MP","وا۟|N|PRON|SUFF|3MP"],["ٱلْ|P|DET|PREF|LEM:ال","كِتَٰبَ|N|ROOT:كتب|LEM:كِتاب|M|ACC"],["وَ|P|CONJ|PREF|LEM:و","يَزْدَادَ|V|IMPF|VF:8|ROOT:زيد|LEM:ازْدادُ|3MS|MOOD:SUBJ"],["ٱلَّذِينَ|N|REL|LEM:الَّذِي|MP"],["ءَامَنُ|V|PERF|VF:4|ROOT:أمن|LEM:آمَنَ|3MP","وٓا۟|N|PRON|SUFF|3MP"],["إِيمَٰنًا|N|VN|VF:4|ROOT:أمن|LEM:إِيمان|M|INDEF|ACC"],["وَ|P|CONJ|PREF|LEM:و","لَا|P|NEG|LEM:لا"],["يَرْتَابَ|V|IMPF|VF:8|ROOT:ريب|LEM:ارْتابَ|3MS|MOOD:SUBJ"],["ٱلَّذِينَ|N|REL|LEM:الَّذِي|MP"],["أُوتُ|V|PERF|VF:4|PASS|ROOT:أتي|LEM:آتَى|3MP","وا۟|N|PRON|SUFF|3MP"],["ٱلْ|P|DET|PREF|LEM:ال","كِتَٰبَ|N|ROOT:كتب|LEM:كِتاب|M|ACC"],["وَ|P|CONJ|PREF|LEM:و","ٱلْ|P|DET|PREF|LEM:ال","مُؤْمِ